Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|Authentication|

Set Up: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG

Tear Down: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|

Scenario: Test LDAP Connection And Entries
Priority: 3
	Given these properties
		|apacheds.enabled|true|
	When these properties
		|test.name.skip.portal.instance|Authentication#TestLDAPConnectionAndEntries|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Configuration
		|portlet|Instance Settings|
	And PortalSettingsNavigator goto LDAP
	And PortalSettings add LDAP Server
		|LDAPServerName|ApacheDS Server|
	And PortalSettingsNavigator goto LDAP
	And PortalSettings edit LDAP Server
		|LDAPServerName|ApacheDS Server|
	Then PortalSettings test LDAP Connection

Scenario: View Authentication CAS
Priority: 3
	Given these properties
		|test.name.skip.portal.instance|Authentication#ViewAuthenticationCAS|
	When ProductMenu goto Control Panel Configuration
		|portlet|Instance Settings|
	Then PortalSettings view Authentication CASCP

