Scenario: View Instance Setting Enable LDAP Auth Not Affect System Setting
Priority: 3
	Given these properties
		|test.name.skip.portal.instance|Authentication#ViewInstanceSettingEnableLDAPAuthNotAffectSystemSetting|
	When ProductMenu goto Control Panel Configuration
		|portlet|System Settings|
	And SystemSettings goto Category
		|category|Foundation|
	And SystemSettings view Configuration
		|configurationName|LDAP Auth|
		|enableLDAP|false|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Configuration
		|portlet|Instance Settings|
	And PortalSettingsNavigator goto LDAP
	And PortalSettings enable LDAP Setting
		|enableCheckboxKey|ENABLED|
	And PortalSettingsNavigator goto LDAP
	And PortalSettings view Enabled LDAP Setting
		|enableCheckboxKey|ENABLED|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Configuration
		|portlet|System Settings|
	And SystemSettings goto Category
		|category|Foundation|
	Then SystemSettings view Configuration
		|configurationName|LDAP Auth|
		|enableLDAP|false|